{"seq":2,"slug":"audio-spectrogram","title":"音频频谱表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/audio-spectrogram","wordCount":1546,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"音频频谱表示\">音频频谱表示</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>频谱表示把一维波形转换成二维时频图像，理解它需要抓住四个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时频变换是入口</strong>：STFT 在滑动窗口内做傅里叶变换，得到时间×频率的二维表示。</li>\n<li><strong>Mel 尺度贴合人耳</strong>：Mel 滤波器组把线性频率压缩为对数感知尺度，是 AI 音频生成最主流的中间表示。</li>\n<li><strong>相位丢失催生声码器</strong>：从幅度谱重建波形需要估计相位，Griffin-Lim、HiFi-GAN、Vocos 等方法各有权衡。</li>\n<li><strong>学习型编码是趋势</strong>：EnCodec、SoundStream 等编码器用 RVQ 学出最优表示，把音频直接变成离散 Token。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四个要点共同回答了&quot;频谱是什么、为什么用 Mel、怎么变回声音、表示本身能否被学习&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从波形到频谱的视角转换\">从波形到频谱的视角转换</h2><p>原始音频波形是一维时间序列信号，直接用于深度学习面临维度灾难——一段 10 秒 44.1kHz 音频包含 441,000 个采样点。频谱表示通过时频变换将一维信号转为二维图像，大幅降低序列长度同时保留听觉相关信息：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X(t, f) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x(\\tau) \\cdot w(\\tau - t) \\cdot e^{-j2\\pi f\\tau} \\, d\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3846em;vertical-align:-0.9703em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4143em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9703em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是短时傅里叶变换（STFT）——在每个时间窗口内计算频率成分，得到时间-频率二维表示。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方法</th>\n<th>数据形状</th>\n<th>信息保留</th>\n<th>常用模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始波形</td>\n<td>1D (T samples)</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>WaveNet/SampleRNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>STFT 幅度谱</td>\n<td>2D (F×T)</td>\n<td>幅度（丢失相位）</td>\n<td>CNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mel 频谱图</td>\n<td>2D (M×T)</td>\n<td>感知加权频率</td>\n<td>主流选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MFCC</td>\n<td>2D (C×T)</td>\n<td>频谱包络</td>\n<td>传统 ML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CQT</td>\n<td>2D (B×T)</td>\n<td>恒Q（对数频率）</td>\n<td>音高分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复数 STFT</td>\n<td>3D (F×T×2)</td>\n<td>完整（幅度+相位）</td>\n<td>高保真重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 时域[&quot;时域信号&quot;]&#10;        W[&quot;波形 x(t)&lt;br/&gt;44.1kHz, 16bit&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 变换[&quot;时频变换&quot;]&#10;        STFT[&quot;STFT&lt;br/&gt;窗函数+FFT&quot;]&#10;        MEL[&quot;Mel 滤波器组&lt;br/&gt;感知频率压缩&quot;]&#10;        LOG[&quot;对数压缩&lt;br/&gt;dB刻度&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 频域[&quot;频域表示&quot;]&#10;        SP[&quot;线性频谱图&lt;br/&gt;F频点×T帧&quot;]&#10;        MS[&quot;Mel频谱图&lt;br/&gt;M Mel频段×T帧&quot;]&#10;        MF[&quot;MFCC&lt;br/&gt;C系数×T帧&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    W --&gt; STFT --&gt; SP&#10;    SP --&gt; MEL --&gt; MS&#10;    MS --&gt; LOG&#10;    MS --&gt; MF\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 时域[\"时域信号\"]\n        W[\"波形 x(t)&lt;br/&gt;44.1kHz, 16bit\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 变换[\"时频变换\"]\n        STFT[\"STFT&lt;br/&gt;窗函数+FFT\"]\n        MEL[\"Mel 滤波器组&lt;br/&gt;感知频率压缩\"]\n        LOG[\"对数压缩&lt;br/&gt;dB刻度\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 频域[\"频域表示\"]\n        SP[\"线性频谱图&lt;br/&gt;F频点×T帧\"]\n        MS[\"Mel频谱图&lt;br/&gt;M Mel频段×T帧\"]\n        MF[\"MFCC&lt;br/&gt;C系数×T帧\"]\n    end\n    W --&gt; STFT --&gt; SP\n    SP --&gt; MEL --&gt; MS\n    MS --&gt; LOG\n    MS --&gt; MF</pre><h2 id=\"mel-频谱图详解\">Mel 频谱图详解</h2><p>Mel 频谱图（Mel Spectrogram）是 AI 音频生成中最主流的中间表示。它通过 Mel 滤波器组将线性频率轴压缩为对数感知尺度，模拟人耳对频率的非线性感知：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2595</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><mn>700</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(Hz → Mel)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = 2595 \\cdot \\log_{10}\\left(1 + \\frac{f}{700}\\right) \\quad \\text{(Hz → Mel)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2595</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">700</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(Hz → Mel)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2595</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(Mel → Hz)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 700 \\cdot (10^{m/2595} - 1) \\quad \\text{(Mel → Hz)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">700</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.188em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2595</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(Mel → Hz)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>低频区域获得更高的频率分辨率（人耳对低频变化更敏感），高频区域被压缩（人耳分辨力下降）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型设置</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FFT 窗长</td>\n<td>1024–2048 samples</td>\n<td>频率分辨率 vs 时间分辨率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hop Length</td>\n<td>256–512 samples</td>\n<td>帧率（时间步密度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mel Bands</td>\n<td>80–128</td>\n<td>频率维度大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Freq Range</td>\n<td>20Hz–8000/16000Hz</td>\n<td>覆盖频率范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Window Type</td>\n<td>Hann / Hamming</td>\n<td>旁瓣抑制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power</td>\n<td>1.0 (mag) / 2.0 (power)</td>\n<td>幅度或能量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 参数选择[&quot;STFT参数&quot;]&#10;        N[&quot;N_FFT: 1024&lt;br/&gt;频率分辨率43Hz&quot;]&#10;        H[&quot;Hop: 256&lt;br/&gt;帧率172fps&quot;]&#10;        W[&quot;Window: Hann&lt;br/&gt;旁瓣-31dB&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Mel变换[&quot;Mel变换&quot;]&#10;        FB[&quot;Mel Filter Bank&lt;br/&gt;80 triangular filters&quot;]&#10;        DB[&quot;Log Scale&lt;br/&gt;dB压缩动态范围&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出[&quot;Mel频谱图&quot;]&#10;        M[&quot;Shape: 80×T&lt;br/&gt;每秒172帧&quot;]&#10;        R[&quot;Range: -80 to 0 dB&lt;br/&gt;归一化到0-1&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    N --&gt; FB&#10;    H --&gt; FB&#10;    W --&gt; FB&#10;    FB --&gt; DB --&gt; M --&gt; R\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 参数选择[\"STFT参数\"]\n        N[\"N_FFT: 1024&lt;br/&gt;频率分辨率43Hz\"]\n        H[\"Hop: 256&lt;br/&gt;帧率172fps\"]\n        W[\"Window: Hann&lt;br/&gt;旁瓣-31dB\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Mel变换[\"Mel变换\"]\n        FB[\"Mel Filter Bank&lt;br/&gt;80 triangular filters\"]\n        DB[\"Log Scale&lt;br/&gt;dB压缩动态范围\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出[\"Mel频谱图\"]\n        M[\"Shape: 80×T&lt;br/&gt;每秒172帧\"]\n        R[\"Range: -80 to 0 dB&lt;br/&gt;归一化到0-1\"]\n    end\n    N --&gt; FB\n    H --&gt; FB\n    W --&gt; FB\n    FB --&gt; DB --&gt; M --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"频谱图的逆变换与相位问题\">频谱图的逆变换与相位问题</h2><p>频谱表示的一个核心挑战是逆变换：从 Mel 频谱图恢复音频波形时，相位信息已经丢失。这催生了多种相位恢复/声码器技术：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Vocoder</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>相位需从幅度估计或学习</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{x}(t) = \\text{Vocoder}(|X(t,f)|) \\quad \\text{相位需从幅度估计或学习}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Vocoder</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相位需从幅度估计或学习</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Griffin-Lim</td>\n<td>迭代相位估计</td>\n<td>中等（有伪影）</td>\n<td>慢（50+迭代）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WaveGlow</td>\n<td>Flow模型直接生成波形</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HiFi-GAN</td>\n<td>GAN判别器指导重建</td>\n<td>高（接近真实）</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vocos</td>\n<td>频域卷积声码器</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BigVGAN</td>\n<td>大规模GAN声码器</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 生成模型[&quot;生成模型输出&quot;]&#10;        MG[&quot;Mel频谱图&lt;br/&gt;80×T float&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 声码器[&quot;声码器选择&quot;]&#10;        GL[&quot;Griffin-Lim&lt;br/&gt;无需训练/质量低&quot;]&#10;        HG[&quot;HiFi-GAN&lt;br/&gt;需训练/质量高&quot;]&#10;        VO[&quot;Vocos&lt;br/&gt;频域方法/极快&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 波形[&quot;音频波形&quot;]&#10;        AU[&quot;PCM 44.1kHz&lt;br/&gt;可直接播放&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    MG --&gt; GL --&gt; AU&#10;    MG --&gt; HG --&gt; AU&#10;    MG --&gt; VO --&gt; AU\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 生成模型[\"生成模型输出\"]\n        MG[\"Mel频谱图&lt;br/&gt;80×T float\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 声码器[\"声码器选择\"]\n        GL[\"Griffin-Lim&lt;br/&gt;无需训练/质量低\"]\n        HG[\"HiFi-GAN&lt;br/&gt;需训练/质量高\"]\n        VO[\"Vocos&lt;br/&gt;频域方法/极快\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 波形[\"音频波形\"]\n        AU[\"PCM 44.1kHz&lt;br/&gt;可直接播放\"]\n    end\n    MG --&gt; GL --&gt; AU\n    MG --&gt; HG --&gt; AU\n    MG --&gt; VO --&gt; AU</pre><p>声码器的质量直接影响最终音频的感知质量。即使生成模型产生了完美的 Mel 频谱图，劣质声码器也会引入明显伪影——金属感、水声、气泡声等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多分辨率频谱与-cqt\">多分辨率频谱与 CQT</h2><p>标准 STFT 在所有频率使用相同的窗长，导致低频时间分辨率差、高频频率分辨率差。常数 Q 变换（CQT）用对数间隔的频率中心和可变窗长解决这个问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>CQT</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>n</mi></munder><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{\\text{CQT}}(k, t) = \\sum_{n} x(t+n) \\cdot w_k(n) \\cdot e^{-j2\\pi Q n / N_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CQT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个频率 bin 的带宽与中心频率成正比（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f_k / f_k = \\text{const}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">const</span></span></span></span></span></span>），与音乐中八度等距的特性天然匹配。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>STFT</th>\n<th>CQT</th>\n<th>对AI的意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>频率间隔</td>\n<td>线性等距</td>\n<td>对数等距</td>\n<td>CQT更贴合音乐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低频分辨率</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>贝斯/鼓更清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高频分辨率</td>\n<td>过高</td>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>减少冗余</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间分辨率</td>\n<td>全频统一</td>\n<td>高频更快</td>\n<td>瞬态捕捉更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆变换</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>CQT重建更难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>低（FFT）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>训练时可接受</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CQT 特别适合音高相关的任务（音高估计、和弦识别、旋律提取），而 Mel 频谱图在通用音频生成中更主流——因为已有成熟的声码器生态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习型音频编码\">学习型音频编码</h2><p>近年来，learned audio codecs（学习型音频编码）已成为 AI 音乐生成的新基石。与手工设计的 STFT/Mel 不同，这些编码器通过训练学习最优的音频压缩表示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>Encoder</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mtext>Decoder</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\text{Encoder}(x) \\in \\mathbb{R}^{T&#x27; \\times D}, \\quad \\hat{x} = \\text{Decoder}(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Encoder</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1869em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9925em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8278em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Decoder</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代表性模型如 Meta 的 EnCodec 和 Google 的 SoundStream 将 24kHz 音频压缩到极低比特率（1.5–24 kbps），同时保持高重建质量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码器</th>\n<th>组织</th>\n<th>码本数</th>\n<th>采样率</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EnCodec</td>\n<td>Meta</td>\n<td>2–32</td>\n<td>24/48kHz</td>\n<td>64–320x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SoundStream</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>3–18</td>\n<td>24kHz</td>\n<td>64–320x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAC</td>\n<td>Descript</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>44.1kHz</td>\n<td>~90x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mimi</td>\n<td>Kyutai</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>24kHz</td>\n<td>~150x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 编码[&quot;编码器&quot;]&#10;        IN[&quot;音频输入&lt;br/&gt;24kHz mono&quot;]&#10;        EN[&quot;Conv Encoder&lt;br/&gt;下采样320x&quot;]&#10;        RVQ[&quot;RVQ量化&lt;br/&gt;8码本×1024词&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 码本[&quot;离散Token&quot;]&#10;        T[&quot;Token序列&lt;br/&gt;75 tokens/sec × 8层&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 解码[&quot;解码器&quot;]&#10;        DQ[&quot;反量化&lt;br/&gt;码本查找&quot;]&#10;        DE[&quot;Conv Decoder&lt;br/&gt;上采样320x&quot;]&#10;        OUT[&quot;音频输出&lt;br/&gt;24kHz重建&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    IN --&gt; EN --&gt; RVQ --&gt; T&#10;    T --&gt; DQ --&gt; DE --&gt; OUT\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 编码[\"编码器\"]\n        IN[\"音频输入&lt;br/&gt;24kHz mono\"]\n        EN[\"Conv Encoder&lt;br/&gt;下采样320x\"]\n        RVQ[\"RVQ量化&lt;br/&gt;8码本×1024词\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 码本[\"离散Token\"]\n        T[\"Token序列&lt;br/&gt;75 tokens/sec × 8层\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 解码[\"解码器\"]\n        DQ[\"反量化&lt;br/&gt;码本查找\"]\n        DE[\"Conv Decoder&lt;br/&gt;上采样320x\"]\n        OUT[\"音频输出&lt;br/&gt;24kHz重建\"]\n    end\n    IN --&gt; EN --&gt; RVQ --&gt; T\n    T --&gt; DQ --&gt; DE --&gt; OUT</pre><p>学习型编码的关键创新是残差向量量化（RVQ）——将连续向量通过多层码本逐步逼近，每层编码前一层的残差。这使得 Token 化的音频可以直接用语言模型的方法（自回归生成）来处理，实现了符号表示与音频表示的统一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>频谱表示把长波形压缩成时频二维图像，兼顾序列长度与听觉相关信息。</li>\n<li>STFT 提供线性频谱，Mel 滤波器组进一步压缩为感知尺度，是最主流的中间表示。</li>\n<li>逆变换的瓶颈是相位丢失，声码器质量直接决定最终音频的感知质量。</li>\n<li>CQT 以对数频率间隔更贴合音高任务，Mel 则拥有更成熟的声码器生态。</li>\n<li>EnCodec、SoundStream 等学习型编码用 RVQ 产出离散 Token，打通了音频与语言模型方法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"音频频谱表示","id":"音频频谱表示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从波形到频谱的视角转换","id":"从波形到频谱的视角转换"},{"level":2,"text":"Mel 频谱图详解","id":"mel-频谱图详解"},{"level":2,"text":"频谱图的逆变换与相位问题","id":"频谱图的逆变换与相位问题"},{"level":2,"text":"多分辨率频谱与 CQT","id":"多分辨率频谱与-cqt"},{"level":2,"text":"学习型音频编码","id":"学习型音频编码"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MIDI 与符号音乐表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/symbolic-midi"},"next":{"title":"音乐 Token 化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/tokenization"}}